Starsealed Edict (5★ catalyst) for gcsim, from an unmerged gcsim pull request.

Source: https://github.com/genshinsim/gcsim/pull/3279 by Lou Chauvin, at commit 2b3320f (2026-11-19,
        after "fix issues from review"), based on gcsim v2.50.0.
Not reviewed or accepted by gcsim's maintainers yet: results with this weapon are experimental.

Only the weapon is taken: its folder (internal/weapons/catalyst/starsealed) and its lines in gcsim's
weapon lists (catalog, keys, shortcuts "starsealededict"/"edict"/"starsealed", imports, assets). The
pull request's branch also contains three unrelated fixes gcsim merged after v2.50.0 (Mizuki C2,
Mavuika's bike frames, Nocturne's Curtain Call); those are left out and will come with the next
gcsim release. The website files (ui/) are left out too. No other changes.

This file is applied by scripts/build-gcsim.sh. When gcsim includes Starsealed Edict itself, the
build skips it and says so; then delete this file.

